      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Hogwarts Legacy receives an NVIDIA DLSS 5 upgrade with 3D-Guided Neural Rendering today, bringing lifelike lighting and materials to the wizarding world on GeForce NOW .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA DLSS 5 with 3D-Guided Neural Rendering arrives in Hogwarts Legacy today, giving members a new reason to return to Hogwarts, streaming from Steam, Epic Games and Xbox with Play Anywhere support.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Games under the Portkey Games label and developed by Avalanche Software, Hogwarts Legacy is an immersive, open-world action role-playing game set in the 1800s wizarding world.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Avalanche Software has tuned the integration through DLSS 5’s developer controls to maintain the game’s artistic intent and style.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Hogwarts Legacy also includes support for the DLSS Multi Frame Generation and Ray Reconstruction features, accelerating and enhancing the ray-traced graphics that immerse players in Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Thanks to NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 controls in the cloud, members can fine-tune their experience.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Ultimate members can experience the update with GeForce RTX 5080-class performance across PCs, Macs, handhelds, browsers, mobile devices, compatible TVs and more, without an expensive PC upgrade or waiting for game downloads.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "4, and is streaming on GeForce NOW, inviting players into a reimagined original Azeroth built to keep growing for years to come.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "At launch, GeForce NOW plans to support around 100 of the most popular CurseForge add-ons, with the selection evolving to reflect player favorites.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Play solo or in co-op, with a level boost available for agents below level 40.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T14:00:34.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:27.817Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For the full DLSS 5 experience in Hogwarts Legacy , an Ultimate day pass is the ticket — no Sorting Hat required.",
